Constant Objective-C literals' sections in __DATA_CONST, where Xcode 27.0's ld puts them: __objc_arraydata,
__objc_arrayobj, __objc_dictobj, __objc_doubleobj, __objc_floatobj and __objc_intobj, which clang writes in __DATA
(docs/formats/build.md "Objective-C literals, runtime entrypoints and `this`", .github/clang 0001).

